# persistent-state-minimum: the Persistent State cap at its conformance
# minimum, 67108864, which every Core must honour exactly. `hoard` has one
# Script Variable and nothing else it keeps between Runs, and a Run that is
# ending doesn't count its own frames, so at a Run's end its Persistent
# State is size(big) = 16 + the UTF-8 length of `big` (chapter 6, Limits).
#
# `fill` puts 67108848 "x"s in `big`: state 16 + 67108848 = 67108864, the cap
# exactly, so it completes. `grow` appends one more: 67108865, measured at
# its Segment's end, the `return` at hoard:38 (source 21:1). That faults, and
# the rollback puts `big` back, so the faulting Segment's `state` is measured
# after it: the cap again. `clear` then empties it, so the closing `vars` is
# short.
#
# Pinned here: the state at the cap, the fault and its instruction, and the
# rollback. Fuel and allocation figures are estimates (`fill`'s are summed
# over its 22 passes from Cost Model 0's rates: `iterate-times` 24, and
# each pass's two appends 8 + size(s) each).
# Unblessed: the output lines are written by hand, not by bless.

> load hoard

> deliver d1 to=hoard message=fill
> pump clock=2026-09-28T09:00:00Z
seg hoard/r1 start delivery=d1 handler=fill clause=1 fuel=16777650 alloc=134218776 state=67108864 end=return
run hoard/r1 outcome=completed delivery=d1 handler=fill fuel=16777650 alloc=134218776
pumped state=idle fuel=16777650

# One byte over the cap: a Limit Fault at the Segment's end.
> deliver d2 to=hoard message=grow
> pump clock=2026-09-28T09:00:01Z
fault hoard/r2 limit=persistent at=hoard:38 pos=21:1 rollback=[big]
seg hoard/r2 start delivery=d2 handler=grow clause=1 fuel=4194320 alloc=25 state=67108864 end=fault
run hoard/r2 outcome=limit-fault delivery=d2 handler=grow limit=persistent fuel=4194320 alloc=25
pumped state=idle fuel=4194320

> deliver d3 to=hoard message=clear
> pump clock=2026-09-28T09:00:02Z
seg hoard/r3 start delivery=d3 handler=clear clause=1 fuel=10 alloc=0 state=16 end=return
run hoard/r3 outcome=completed delivery=d3 handler=clear fuel=10 alloc=0
pumped state=idle fuel=10

> vars
vars hoard big=""
